  Constraints  All characters are lowercase English letters. Output Format  Print an integer denoting the zero-indexed position of the character that makes  not a palindrome; if  is already a palindrome or no such character exists, print .  Sample Input  3 aaab baa aaa Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":229712,"global_rank":113251,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19640},{"name":"bjherger/naive-bayes-classifier","owner":"bjherger","html_url":"https://github.com/bjherger/naive-bayes-classifier","stars":0,"forks":6,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A simple naive bayes classifier implemented in python. Designed to be robust and quickly implemented.","topics":[],"score":229711,"global_rank":113253,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19641},{"name":"yasoob/flask-login","owner":"yasoob","html_url":"https://github.com/yasoob/flask-login","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A sample application showing how to deal with login and signup in flask","topics":[],"score":229708,"global_rank":113255,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19642},{"name":"AcroMace/whistlesheet","owner":"AcroMace","html_url":"https://github.com/AcroMace/whistlesheet","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Turn whistles into sheet music","topics":[],"score":229699,"global_rank":113265,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19643},{"name":"hparik11/Flappy_Bird_Game","owner":"hparik11","html_url":"https://github.com/hpari